      "html.text.001": "AI ENGINEERING — F3",
      "html.text.002": "AI PRODUCT LEAD SKILLS",
      "html.text.003": "01 / 01 — BY WISE PPT",
      "html.text.004": "AI 产品负责人需要同时具备认知、工程与落地能力，任何一柱缺失都会卡住交付。",
      "script.literal.001": "认知奠基",
      "script.literal.002": "FOUNDATIONS",
